  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study visit United Nations Global Compact</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to train the General Secretary of the Global Compact Network Democratic Republic of the Congo (DR Congo), which is now under construction with the support of the Netherlands embassy in Kinshasa, DR Congo. The United Nations Global Compact (UNGC) is an initiative to encourage businesses worldwide to adopt sustainable and socially responsible policies and to report on their implementation.The members have hired their General Secretary. He will be responsible for coordinating the day-to-day work of the network. He will travel to Nairobi for a study visit and on-the-job training (stage) at Global Compact Network Kenya. During this visit, he will learn how to coordinate the local work in Nairobi, communicate with the UNGC headquarters, support the further development of the networks and apply an anti-corruption strategic plan.</narrative>
  </description>
